  // Provide Viewership - the API invents a prerequisite in regular only.
  // Proof: https://github.com/tarkovtracker-org/tarkov-data-overlay/issues/324
  //        https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/wiki/Provide_Viewership
  //
  // The 2026-08-27 regular capture carries `AvailableForStart: []` for this task
  // - an explicitly empty list on a present template, which is what licenses
  // `taskRequirements: []` here rather than an absent-from-capture guess. The
  // 1.1-pve capture is identical, and tarkov.dev's pve record already serves no
  // prerequisite; only its regular record adds Easy Money - Part 2 [PVP ZONE]
  // (66058cb5ae4719735349b9e8). The wiki page lists no Requirements section.
  //
  // That spurious edge is also the most likely cause of #324: it is the only
  // link from a mode-shared task into the PVP-ZONE Easy Money chain, so a
  // consumer that walks the regular graph surfaces a [PVP ZONE] task for
  // players who never see it.
  '675c15fbf7da9792a4059871': {
    taskRequirements: [], // Was: Easy Money - Part 2 [PVP ZONE] (active, complete)
  },

